# Plans

Use workspace `.cursor/plans/` (plural). Never use `.cursor/plan/`.

- **Repo copy (git):** `.cursor/plans/<topic>.plan.md`
- **Preview copy:** leave Cursor’s file under `~/.cursor/plans/` in place. Do not delete it.
- After CreatePlan, copy the same content into `.cursor/plans/` in this repo.
- Do not write plans to `.cursor/plan/` or `docs/superpowers/specs/`.
